sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS edge TLS
    participant Proxy as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Allowlist as AllowlistValidator<br/>(in-process)
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefiller Pod<br/>configurable port HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL V2)

    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Header: x-prefiller-host-port
    Route->>Proxy: Forward (edge TLS termination)
    Proxy->>Allowlist: Validate prefiller target IP
    Allowlist-->>Proxy: Allowed (IP in InferencePool pod set)

    Note over Proxy,Prefiller: Phase 1: Prefill
    Proxy->>Prefiller: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>max_tokens=1, stream=false<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    Prefiller-->>Proxy: Prefill response<br/>with kv_transfer_params

    Note over Proxy,Decoder: Phase 2: Decode
    Proxy->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>original body + kv_transfer_params<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    Decoder-->>Proxy: Completion response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: Direct Decode Passthrough (no x-prefiller-host-port header)

    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(no prefiller header)
    Route->>Proxy: Forward
    Proxy->>Decoder: Reverse proxy passthrough<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    Decoder-->>Proxy: Completion response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Allowlist,Prefiller: Flow 3: SSRF Allowlist Maintenance (background)

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Allowlist->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool CRDs<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI-->>Allowlist: InferencePool events
    Allowlist->>K8sAPI: Watch matching Pods<br/>(label selector from pool)
    K8sAPI-->>Allowlist: Pod add/update/delete events
    Note over Allowlist: Rebuild host IP allowlist<br/>on every pod change
